# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# Claude Code local settings
.claude/

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

.vercel
.env*

# --- .scratch/ ---------------------------------------------------------
# Thu muc nhap. Do 28/08/2026: 228 file chua theo doi, 34 MB — anh chup man
# hinh, mp4, tts-cache, log, va cookies.txt chua cookie phien DA KY cua 3 tai
# khoan admin thu. Repo nay CONG KHAI, nen mot lan `git add .` la lo that.
#
# Luat: bo qua tat ca, TRU file .md nam TRONG THU MUC CON — do dung la quy uoc
# issue tracker cua du an (.scratch/<feature-slug>/spec.md, xem
# docs/agents/issue-tracker.md). File .md nam ngay duoi .scratch/ la ghi chu
# nhap (trong do co ban sao 346 KB cua docs/NHAT_KY.md) nen KHONG theo doi.
#
# ⚠️ Dong `!.scratch/**/` la BAT BUOC, dung xoa: git khong mo lai duoc mot file
# neu thu muc cha cua no dang bi loai.
.scratch/**
!.scratch/**/
!.scratch/*/**/*.md

# Ban sao luu kho tai khoan quan tri (npm run vault:backup).
# ⚠️ Moi file .enc o day co gia tri ngang toan bo quyen quan tri: no chua
# AUTH_PEPPER va ban bam mat khau, ma hoa bang AUTH_BACKUP_KEY. KHONG BAO GIO
# commit. Cat ban that o cho khac may nay.
/backups/
# ⚠️ Va bat cu file .enc nao o bat cu dau — chung deu la ban sao kho tai khoan.
*.enc

# Video dung ra tu `npm run video:render` — file nang, khong dua vao git.
/out/
